# Conventions

- Files kebab-case (`order-summary.tsx`), components PascalCase, functions/hooks camelCase, constants UPPER_SNAKE_CASE.
- Explicit types, short functions, issue-scoped diffs, no drive-by refactors. No secrets in code or comments.
- No comments that restate the code. Keep only non-obvious constraints, footguns and product decisions.
- Biome formats and lints (`pnpm check`). No `any` without a reason in a comment.
- Money is always integer minor units (TND millimes, EUR cents). Format with `formatMoney` from `@workspace/sdk`.
- Tests: `bun test`, files in the package's `test/` folder mirroring the source path (`packages/orpc/test/router.test.ts`),
  never beside the source; e2e in `/test/e2e`. One test per behavior, real Postgres for api tests (`DATABASE_URL`), mock
  only network and time. Run only touched packages while iterating. `pnpm rules:check` fails on a test outside `test/`.
- E2E: one spec per feature (`test/e2e/specs/<feature>.e2e.ts`), every user-visible step through `step()` so it is
  screenshotted, select by role or label, no `waitForTimeout`. A flaky test is a bug to fix; no skip without an issue number.
- UI text: fr/en/ar about the same length.
- Accessibility: labelled controls, 44px touch targets, AA contrast, visible focus. Mobile first, then desktop.
